\viewkind4\uc1\pard\nowidctlpar\lang1033\b\f0\fs16 EwE6\b0  was initially developed through funding from Lenfest Ocean Program with additional support from the Pew Charitable Trusts. We thank Margaret Bowman for support. Since version 6.2, EwE is developed entirely without core funding under the Ecopath Research and Development Consortium.\par
\par
\b EwE release 6.3\b0  was made possible by CSIRO, we thank Beth Fulton and Rodrigo Bustamante for support.\par
\par
\b ENA\b0  (Ecological Network Analysis) module was funded by the Scottish Association for Marine Science and the Lenfest Ocean Program. We thank Sheila Heymans for supervising the development and testing ENA.\par
\par
\b Ecoseed\b0  was developed through funding from the David and Lucile Packard Foundation through the Duke University EBM-Tools Development Innovation Fund.\par
\par
\b Ecotracer\b0  was developed with funding from the Finnish Institute of Marine Research through a contract with the European Union. The development was further being supported by the Lenfest Ocean Program and the Pew Charitable Trusts.\par
\par
\b Habitat Capacity Model\b0  was developed with funding from the Nereus Program and the CHARM project.\par
\par
\b Pedigree\b0  spreadsheet was based on a suggestion from Kerim Aydin.\par
\par
\b Value chain\b0  was developed with funding from the North Sea Centre and the ECOST project. We thank Pierre Failler and Hoaran Pan for their input.\par
\par
